Boggle UK game dictionary

This file is the runtime dictionary used by the Boggle variant.

It is intentionally generated from the SCOWL corpus, then filtered to remove:
- proper nouns and place names such as CHESHIRE and LONDON
- offensive or unsuitable words
- non-letter or out-of-range entries
- US spellings that are normalised to UK game spellings such as COLOUR and ORGANISE

Retired as of the dict_en_v17 dictionary swap: js/boggle.js now loads
data/dict_en_v17.txt, so this file is no longer fetched by the game. It is kept
for reference and for rebuilds of the previous word list. The raw SCOWL source
remains available for the same purpose.
